# =========================================================================
# GIT ATTRIBUTES FILE
# Standardizes text formats and line endings (as per 23_Coding_Standards.md)
# =========================================================================

# Enforce LF endings on checkouts for all text files (prevents Windows CR+LF clashes)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit syntax markers for visual diffs
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.json text
*.css text
*.md text
*.mdx text

# Configure binary formats to prevent automated merges or line alterations
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.webm binary
